  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"Shipping & Delivery — 25–30 Days, Tracked, Duties Prepaid | MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"How a MOMUTO order ships: mockup in 24–48h, 7–12 days production, 10–15 days tracked shipping — 25–30 days door to door. Free over €50, duties prepaid.\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/shipping-policy\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"breadcrumb\": {\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n    \"itemListElement\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 2,\n        \"name\": \"From Order to Your Door\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/shipping-policy\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I track my order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Every order ships tracked; the tracking number arrives by email as soon as the parcel leaves, and you can follow it in the carrier's tracking page and in the Order Status section of your account.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you deliver to my country?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We ship worldwide with a certified international courier, and with Royal Mail in the UK. Customers in Spain, France, Italy and the United States get local carriers and local prices on their own MOMUTO store.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will I pay customs or import duties?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No — duties are prepaid by MOMUTO. In the rare case a carrier still asks you to pay, send the receipt to orders@momuto.com and we refund the amount.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you guarantee a delivery date?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We can't guarantee a date — global logistics occasionally slip — but more than 95% of orders arrive within 25–30 days, and the fast lane (+€59) buys roughly a week. Tell us your deadline before ordering and we'll say honestly whether it's realistic.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I change the delivery address?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Before the parcel ships, yes — email customer@momuto.com with your order number and we update it. Once it's with the carrier we'll ask them to redirect where their service allows, but it can't be promised.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"The parcel arrived damaged or something is missing\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Write to customer@momuto.com within 7 days of delivery with photos of the parcel and the items. Damage in transit and missing pieces are replaced or refunded — see the returns & exchanges policy.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" /><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\" /><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<style>\n.title, .page-title { display: none !important; }\n:root { --bg:#0a0a0a; --panel:#111; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --white:#f5f5f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --dim:#71717a; --red:#c8352e; --red-h:#e04038; --fd:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; --fb:'Outfit',sans-serif; }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\nbody{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:300;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);line-height:1.65;overflow-x:hidden}\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1}\n.acc{color:var(--red)}\n.faqpage{margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw)}\n.wrap{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}\n.hero{padding:5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#1a1a1a 0%,var(--bg) 70%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.badge{background:rgba(200,53,46,.1);border:1px solid rgba(200,53,46,.18);color:var(--red);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:6px 14px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1.4rem}\n.h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.2rem);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 1.2rem}\n.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}\n.mo-editor-reset .sub{margin-inline:auto}\n.quick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px;max-width:1060px;margin:2.4rem auto 0;padding:0 1.5rem;text-align:left}\n.mo-editor-reset .quick{margin-inline:auto}\n.q{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:18px 20px}\n.q .k{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--white);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.q .l{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5}\nnav.faqnav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:rgba(10,10,10,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\nnav.faqnav ul{list-style:none !important;margin:0 auto !important;padding:0 1rem !important;max-width:1060px;display:flex !important;gap:.2rem;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}\nnav.faqnav ul::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\nnav.faqnav li{list-style:none !important;display:block !important;flex-shrink:0}\nnav.faqnav li::marker{content:none}\nnav.faqnav a{display:block;padding:14px 12px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap}\nnav.faqnav a:hover{color:var(--white);border-color:var(--red)}\n.sec{padding:3.5rem 0;scroll-margin-top:60px}\n.sec h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.4rem);margin-bottom:.4rem}\n.sec .lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:720px;margin:0 0 1.8rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.sec.alt{background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.faq details{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n.faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n.faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 4px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}\n.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.faq summary::after{content:'+';font-size:24px;color:var(--red);font-weight:300;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0}\n.faq details[open] summary::after{content:'\\2013'}\n.faq .a{margin:0 4px 18px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:820px}\n.faq .a b{color:#e5e5e5;font-weight:600}\n.faq .a a{color:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);text-decoration:none}\n.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel)}\ntable.ladder{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px;font-size:.92rem}\ntable.ladder th{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\ntable.ladder td{padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--white)}\ntable.ladder tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}\ntable.ladder td:first-child{color:var(--muted)}\ntable.ladder tr.pop td{background:rgba(200,53,46,.08);color:#fff;font-weight:600}\ntable.ladder .pill{display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;vertical-align:middle}\nul.notes{list-style:none !important;margin:1.4rem 0 0 !important;padding:0 !important;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:10px 24px}\nul.notes > li{display:flex !important;list-style:none !important;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}\nul.notes > li::marker{content:none}\nul.notes > li .ck{color:var(--red);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}\nul.notes b{color:#e5e5e5;font-weight:600}\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:16px 40px;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--red);transition:all .2s}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--red-h);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.btn2{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--white);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:14px 34px;font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;margin-left:.6rem}\n.btn2:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}\n.cta-end{padding:4.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}\n.cta-end h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:1rem}\n.cta-end p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 2rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.mo-editor-reset .cta-end p{margin-inline:auto}\n.more{padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dim)}\n.more a{color:var(--muted)}\n@media(max-width:520px){.btn2{margin-left:0;margin-top:.8rem}}\n\nul.timeline{list-style:none !important;margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;max-width:820px}\nul.timeline > li{display:flex !important;list-style:none !important;gap:1.2rem;align-items:flex-start;padding:1.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}\nul.timeline > li::marker{content:none}\nul.timeline > li .d{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--red);min-width:132px;line-height:1.15;flex-shrink:0}\nul.timeline > li strong{color:var(--white);font-weight:600}\ntable.ladder td .sub{display:block;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--dim)}\n.faq h3{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 .6rem}\n@media(max-width:600px){ul.timeline > li{flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"faqpage\">\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"badge\">Shipping &amp; delivery</div>\n<h1 class=\"h1\">From Order to <span class=\"acc\">Your Door</span></h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">What happens after you pay, how long each step takes, who delivers where, and what it costs. More than 95% of orders arrive inside the 25–30 day window.</p>\n<div class=\"quick\"><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">25–30 days</div><div class=\"l\">door to door, worldwide</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">Free over €50</div><div class=\"l\">€3.90 below that</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">Tracked</div><div class=\"l\">tracking number by email when it ships</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">Duties prepaid</div><div class=\"l\">no customs surprises</div></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"timeline\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>The timeline</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Custom kits are made to order, so the clock has four parts. The only one you control is how fast you approve the mockup.</p>\n<ul class=\"timeline\">\n<li><span class=\"d\">Day 0</span><span><strong>Order confirmed.</strong> You pay at checkout and get a confirmation email. If anything in your design needs a decision, we email you — keep an eye on your inbox.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"d\">Day 1–2</span><span><strong>Production mockup, 24–48 h.</strong> A designer cleans your crest and sponsor, sets names and numbers, and sends the exact file that will print. Change anything, free. <b>Nothing prints until you approve it.</b></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"d\">Day 3–14</span><span><strong>Production, 7–12 days.</strong> Full dye-sublimation on the polyester-elastane blend, cut and sewn to each player's size.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"d\">Day 15–30</span><span><strong>Shipping, 10–15 days.</strong> Tracked, by the carrier for your zone (table below). You receive the tracking number by email the moment it leaves.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"d\">Delivery</span><span><strong>At your door.</strong> Duties are prepaid by us. Problem with the parcel? Write to <a href=\"mailto:customer@momuto.com\">customer@momuto.com</a> within 7 days with photos.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"zones\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Where we ship, and what it costs</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">One threshold everywhere: free shipping on orders over €50, €3.90 below. Every zone is tracked.</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"ladder\">\n<thead><tr><th>Destination</th><th>Carrier</th><th>Shipping cost</th><th>Door to door</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>United Kingdom</td><td>Royal Mail</td><td>€3.90 · <b>free over €50</b></td><td>25–30 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rest of Europe &amp; worldwide</td><td>Certified international courier</td><td>€3.90 · <b>free over €50</b></td><td>25–30 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td>United States</td><td>USPS <span class=\"sub\">order on <a href=\"https://us.momuto.com\">us.momuto.com</a> — USD prices</span></td><td>$4.90 · <b>free over $59</b></td><td>25–30 days</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Spain · France · Italy</td><td>CTT Express / Correos · Colis Privé · certified courier <span class=\"sub\">local stores: <a href=\"https://es.momuto.com\">es</a> · <a href=\"https://fr.momuto.com\">fr</a> · <a href=\"https://it.momuto.com\">it</a>.momuto.com</span></td><td>€3.90 · <b>free over €50</b></td><td>25–30 days</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<ul class=\"notes\">\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Fast lane: +€59 per order</b> skips the production queue and adds shipping priority — roughly 7 days saved.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Plan 7–9 weeks ahead</b> for a season or tournament and confirm the order 4–5 weeks out; teams spend 2–3 weeks deciding, longer than production itself.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>The clock starts at mockup approval</b>, not at payment — approve fast, receive fast.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Customs duties are prepaid.</b> If a carrier charges you anyway, send the receipt to <a href=\"mailto:orders@momuto.com\">orders@momuto.com</a> and we refund it.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"questions\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Shipping questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Can I track my order?</summary><div class=\"a\">Yes. Every order ships tracked; the tracking number arrives by email as soon as the parcel leaves, and you can follow it in the carrier's tracking page and in the Order Status section of your account.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Do you deliver to my country?</summary><div class=\"a\">We ship worldwide with a certified international courier, and with Royal Mail in the UK. Customers in Spain, France, Italy and the United States get local carriers and local prices on their own MOMUTO store.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Will I pay customs or import duties?</summary><div class=\"a\">No — <b>duties are prepaid by MOMUTO</b>. In the rare case a carrier still asks you to pay, send the receipt to <a href=\"mailto:orders@momuto.com\">orders@momuto.com</a> and we refund the amount.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Can you guarantee a delivery date?</summary><div class=\"a\">We can't guarantee a date — global logistics occasionally slip — but more than 95% of orders arrive within 25–30 days, and the fast lane (+€59) buys roughly a week. Tell us your deadline before ordering and we'll say honestly whether it's realistic.</div></details>\n<details><summary>Can I change the delivery address?</summary><div class=\"a\">Before the parcel ships, yes — email <a href=\"mailto:customer@momuto.com\">customer@momuto.com</a> with your order number and we update it. Once it's with the carrier we'll ask them to redirect where their service allows, but it can't be promised.</div></details>\n<details><summary>The parcel arrived damaged or something is missing</summary><div class=\"a\">Write to <a href=\"mailto:customer@momuto.com\">customer@momuto.com</a> within 7 days of delivery with photos of the parcel and the items. Damage in transit and missing pieces are replaced or refunded — see the <a href=\"/pages/return-policy_b801b8e1\">returns &amp; exchanges policy</a>.</div></details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-end\">\n<h2>Ready When You Are</h2>\n<p>Design it yourself in 3D, free — or send us your idea and a designer builds it. Either way, the mockup lands within 48 hours.</p>\n<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&configId=ypi9qc1z&suitName=mamuto3suit1&lang=en&langguage=en\" class=\"btn\">Design in 3D — free</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/34614625408\" class=\"btn2\">Ask on WhatsApp</a>\n</section>\n<div class=\"more\">Keep exploring: <a href=\"/pages/faq\">FAQ &amp; prices</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/return-policy_b801b8e1\">returns &amp; exchanges</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\">size guide</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/ready-to-play\">Ready to Play designs</a></div>\n</div>\n",
